On Wed, Jan 7, 2009 at 10:43 PM, Sai Emrys <sai@saizai.com> wrote:

> What music do you know of whose lyrics are in a conlang?

There is a lot of Esperanto music with lyrics at:

  http://www.musicexpress.com.br/sercxo.asp

I an not sure if ALL the lyrics at this site is en Esperanto,
but there are definitely very much of it.

If you are interested in other conlangs, there is a Russian
(or rather Litovian ("softo" is the right word!)) punk group
"pichismo", which sings in the many different conlangs, but
all their lyrics is... punk. If you don't like rhymes like
"feki" and "fiki", it is probably not for you.

